     "answer": 1,
     "why": "«Una nueva sede para 20 mil estudiantes»: a sede is a campus, and estudiantes are students.",
     "lesson": "«Mil» is a thousand, not a million (that's «millón»), so 20 mil is 20,000, a big campus but not a city."
