     "answer": 1,
     "why": "«Zum Mitnehmen» means 'to take along': a coffee to go.",
     "lesson": "«Mit» means 'with', so learners think of 'with milk' or 'with sugar'; here «mit» belongs to «mitnehmen», to take with you."
